    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i tried the saline spray but it didnt do anything at all. i feel like i'm suffocating lol. look, i've had high blood pressure for years and my lisinopril keeps it pretty stable. i just need to get through these next two days without losing my mind. surely i can just take one pill and it wont be a huge problem? i'm not asking for a prescription, just if it's actually dangerous or if people just say that to be safe.",
